Traccar Manager for HarmonyOS
Copyright 2026 simon2137

This product is a HarmonyOS (ArkTS / API 26) port of Traccar Manager,
https://github.com/traccar/traccar-manager (commit af0bb3f), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Derived from that project: the screen layout and three-state flow
(loading -> error screen -> full-screen Web), navigation interception
order, the `prefix|payload` JavaScript bridge protocol, the document-start
injection script (including the Blob/xlsx download hook), the deep-link
scheme `org.traccar.manager`, and the launcher icon artwork.
